From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tinycast Recipe <recipe@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:45:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] tinycast-space 0025: faster lists and launch

`DateBucket.Boundaries` resolves Today, Yesterday, this week and this month once per list instead of per row (Clipboard History, Calculator history, AI Chat history and sidebar); the launch-at-login status, an XPC round trip of ~40 ms, is read off the main thread at launch, and a write cancels that read. Two parts of [mSarheed/pipcast](https://github.com/mSarheed/pipcast/commit/de308447); its palette prewarm is left out, since it moves the open palette's memory into idle.

Origin: tinycast-space 0025-faster-lists-and-launch.patch @ ffccfc3
